  <name>cjw_multisite</name>
  <summary>CJW Multisite</summary>
  <description>The CJW Multisite installation package sets up Exponential with the starter site of the CJW Themes Jumper design (extension cjw_themes_jumper, design starter): the site siteaccess in English with a siteaccess for each further language (ger for German), the starter content with its layouts, and the administration (admin, editor, adminui). It installs on SQLite by default: ./console exp:install --package=cjw_multisite --languages=eng-US,ger-DE (choose German too, most of the starter content is German). Without a site title the site is called CJW JAC Exponential. The images and files of the content ship with the extension cjw_themes_jumper (share/content-images, content-files), which the installation needs in extension/.</description>
